('74c92827-8aef-4f0b-904e-fd6d7fdf2aaa', 'Mythic Suites & Villas', '<p>Nestled&nbsp;in&nbsp;tranquil&nbsp;Grand&nbsp;Gaube,&nbsp;on&nbsp;Mauritius’&nbsp;northern&nbsp;coast,&nbsp;Mythic&nbsp;Suites&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Villas&nbsp;offers&nbsp;an&nbsp;intimate&nbsp;retreat&nbsp;where&nbsp;time&nbsp;stands&nbsp;still.&nbsp;This&nbsp;exclusive&nbsp;estate,&nbsp;officially&nbsp;licensed&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;tourism&nbsp;residence&nbsp;and&nbsp;offering&nbsp;bespoke&nbsp;concierge&nbsp;service,&nbsp;invites&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;unwind,&nbsp;reconnect,&nbsp;and&nbsp;embrace&nbsp;freedom.</p><p>Surrounded&nbsp;by&nbsp;genuine&nbsp;yet&nbsp;discreet&nbsp;attention,&nbsp;each&nbsp;villa&nbsp;for&nbsp;rent&nbsp;on&nbsp;Mauritius&nbsp;and&nbsp;every&nbsp;suite&nbsp;invites&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;experience&nbsp;the&nbsp;island&nbsp;at&nbsp;your&nbsp;own&nbsp;pace&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;serene,&nbsp;sunlit&nbsp;ambiance.</p><p></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;11&nbsp;HRS</p>', 'Grand Gaube', 'North Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778579843052-f4uk23qysxj.jpg', '["WIFI","SWIMMING POOL","FITNESS ROOM","HALAL FOOD","COCKTAIL BAR","INTERNATIONAL & MAURITIAN CUISINE","Children''s Corner","SPA"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-12T09:59:16.337+00:00', '2026-05-12T10:14:57.533+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778580600193-0f8dl5bl2mpt.jpg","services/1778580624725-6ur7iw9uqpa.jpg","services/1778580634249-535ii3kjfsn.jpg","services/1778580648918-a29asurpsdh.jpg","services/1778580663389-60w0n4et2oi.jpg","services/1778580676475-fhup022tcua.jpg","services/1778580819895-6ykg1qg7435.jpg","services/1778580840169-omh15y081hc.jpg","services/1778580859313-j1pddm419c.jpg","services/1778580883632-g3w0jywf88d.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1778579906103-9fccephd606.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778579931795-g3kjjllcp8d.jpg', false,