('f07d105f-6a4f-46eb-8a38-9e13b1cfd97c', 'Île des Deux Cocos (Saturday Offer) (From Backup: May 18)', '<p>Île&nbsp;des&nbsp;Deux&nbsp;Cocos&nbsp;is&nbsp;an&nbsp;exclusive&nbsp;private&nbsp;island&nbsp;retreat&nbsp;situated&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;turquoise&nbsp;lagoon&nbsp;of&nbsp;Blue&nbsp;Bay,&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;surrounded&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;protected&nbsp;waters&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Blue&nbsp;Bay&nbsp;Marine&nbsp;Park.&nbsp;Known&nbsp;for&nbsp;its&nbsp;serene&nbsp;atmosphere&nbsp;and&nbsp;natural&nbsp;beauty,&nbsp;the&nbsp;island&nbsp;offers&nbsp;visitors&nbsp;an&nbsp;unforgettable&nbsp;all-inclusive&nbsp;experience&nbsp;featuring&nbsp;snorkeling&nbsp;among&nbsp;colorful&nbsp;coral&nbsp;reefs,&nbsp;relaxing&nbsp;on&nbsp;pristine&nbsp;white-sand&nbsp;beaches,&nbsp;enjoying&nbsp;gourmet&nbsp;buffet&nbsp;meals&nbsp;and&nbsp;unlimited&nbsp;drinks,&nbsp;and&nbsp;participating&nbsp;in&nbsp;fun&nbsp;beach&nbsp;and&nbsp;water&nbsp;activities.&nbsp;The&nbsp;island&nbsp;also&nbsp;features&nbsp;a&nbsp;beautiful&nbsp;Moorish-style&nbsp;villa,&nbsp;tropical&nbsp;gardens,&nbsp;and&nbsp;crystal-clear&nbsp;lagoons,&nbsp;making&nbsp;it&nbsp;a&nbsp;popular&nbsp;destination&nbsp;for&nbsp;romantic&nbsp;getaways,&nbsp;family&nbsp;outings,&nbsp;weddings,&nbsp;and&nbsp;luxury&nbsp;day&nbsp;excursions&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mauritius.</p> (Imported from backup variant: Git Branch: backup/2026-05-18_1854 (SQL))', 'Blue Bay', 'South Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778739897167-ozpzycyv5a.webp', '["wifi","Beachfront","Activities","Lunch Buffet","Drinks"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T19:53:09.482138+00:00', '2026-05-19T19:53:09.482138+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778741623732-gpjpqejqewe.jpg","services/1778741636582-kdc1b6g8ue.jpg","services/1778741644465-gnng219m93s.jpg","services/1778741654993-rrrwmhxgwd.jpg","services/1778741667550-wji14teozwq.jpg","services/1778741678815-yxcoiygbude.jpg","services/1778741707619-qo25h2v4fe.jpg","servi