d&nbsp;the&nbsp;control&nbsp;of&nbsp;ile&nbsp;des&nbsp;deux&nbsp;cocos.&nbsp;Force&nbsp;majeure&nbsp;does&nbsp;not&nbsp;cover&nbsp;the&nbsp;following:&nbsp;economic&nbsp;slowdowns&nbsp;local,&nbsp;regional&nbsp;or&nbsp;global;&nbsp;currency&nbsp;exchange&nbsp;fluctuations;&nbsp;political&nbsp;situations&nbsp;–&nbsp;local,&nbsp;regional&nbsp;or&nbsp;global&nbsp;(this&nbsp;list&nbsp;is&nbsp;not&nbsp;exhaustive)</p>', '<p>50%&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;total&nbsp;amount&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;asked&nbsp;upon&nbsp;confirmation&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;event&nbsp;The&nbsp;difference&nbsp;will&nbsp;have&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;settled&nbsp;30&nbsp;days&nbsp;prior&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;event&nbsp;(45&nbsp;days&nbsp;in&nbsp;peak&nbsp;season)</p>', NULL, 'services/1778740730164-64il78ca8hm.webp', false, 0, 'services/1778742316730-cphorxfcb9j.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Île des Deux Cocos is a private Mauritian island offering luxury day trips, snorkeling, beaches, dining, and all-inclusive experiences.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1778742411737","label":"All Inclusive"}]'::jsonb, 'Sea', 0, NULL),
('806866f0-6896-4ad2-93a2-28db844998f1', 'Grand Bassin & Sacred Temple', '<p>Visit&nbsp;the&nbsp;sacred&nbsp;crater&nbsp;lake&nbsp;of&nbsp;Grand&nbsp;Bassin,&nbsp;home&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;majestic&nbsp;Shiva&nbsp;statue&nbsp;and&nbsp;peaceful&nbsp;Hindu&nbsp;temples&nbsp;surrounded&nbsp;by&nbsp;mountain&nbsp;mist.</p>', 'Ganga Talao', 'South', 4.8, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544735716-392fe2489ffa?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80', '["Culture","Spirituality","Scenery"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T19:53:12.998326+00:00', '2026-05-19T19:53:12.998326+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '["Mangal Mahadev Statue","Sacred Crater Lake","Temple Visit"]'::jsonb, '["Guided Tour","Transport"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', false, 0, '', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Spiritual heart of Mauritius.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, 'Land', 0, NULL),
('c38d5bf8-22ec-46c9-a0ae-d75811357912', 'Lagoon Attitude Hotel', '<p><span style="background-color: rgb(237, 244, 247); color: rgb(78, 89, 101);">Welcome&nbsp;to&nbsp;4*&nbsp;Lagoon&nbsp;Attitude&nbsp;hotel,&nbsp;a</span><strong style="background-color: rgb(237, 244, 247); color: rgb(78, 89, 101);">&nbsp;paradise&nbsp;for&nbsp;nature&nbsp;and&nbsp;sea&nbsp;lovers</strong><span style="background-color: rgb(237, 244, 247); color: rgb(78, 89, 101);">!</span></p><p></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(237, 244, 247); color: rgb(78, 89, 101);">Located&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;edge&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;immense&nbsp;Anse&nbsp;la&nbsp;Raie&nbsp;lagoon&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;north&nbsp;coast&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;the&nbsp;4*&nbsp;Lagoon&nbsp;Attitude&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;our&nbsp;most&nbsp;</span><strong style="background-color: rgb(237, 244, 247); color: rgb(3, 170, 201);"><a href="https://hotels-attitude.com/en/positive-impact" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">eco-committed</a></strong><span style="background-color: rgb(237, 244, 247); color: rgb(78, 89, 101);">&nbsp;property.&nbsp;Thanks&nbsp;to&nbsp;our</span><strong style="background-color: rgb(237, 244, 247); color: rgb(78, 89, 101);">&nbsp;efforts&nbsp;in&nbsp;environmental&nbsp;and&nbsp;social&nbsp;responsibility</strong><span style="background-color: rgb(237, 244, 247); color: rgb(78, 89, 101);">,&nbsp;the&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;has&nbsp;been&nbsp;Travelife&nbsp;Gold&nbsp;certified&nbsp;since&nbsp;2017&nbsp;and&nbsp;Lagoon&nbsp;Attitude&nbsp;is&nbsp;continuing&nbsp;its&nbsp;focus&nbsp;on</span><strong style="background-color: rgb(237, 244, 247); color: rgb(78, 89, 101);">&nbsp;sustainable&nbsp;tourism</strong><span style="background-color: rgb(237, 244, 247); color: rgb(78, 89, 101);">.</span></p><p></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(237, 244, 247); color: rgb(78, 89, 101);">In&nbsp;addition&nbsp;to&nbsp;our&nbsp;upcycling&nbsp;activity,&nbsp;the&nbsp;‘blue&nbsp;nets’&nbsp;program&nbsp;for&nbsp;litter&nbsp;picking&nbsp;and&nbsp;our&nbsp;zero&nbsp;single-use&nbsp;plastic&nbsp;policy,&nbsp;we&nbsp;have&nbsp;created&nbsp;the&nbsp;Marine&nbsp;Discovery&nbsp;Centre,&nbsp;which&nbsp;is&nbsp;dedicated&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;preservation&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;marine&nbsp;ecosystem.</span></p><p></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(237, 244, 247); color: rgb(78, 89, 101);">Lagoon&nbsp;Attitude&nbsp;has&nbsp;also&nbsp;an&nbsp;</span><strong style="background-color: rgb(237, 244, 247); color: rgb(78, 89, 101);">idyllic&nbsp;location&nbsp;for&nbsp;windsurfing&nbsp;and&nbsp;kitesurfing&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mauritius</strong><span style="background-color: rgb(237, 244, 247); color: rgb(78, 89, 101);">.&nbsp;Its&nbsp;typical&nbsp;Mauritian&nbsp;architecture&nbsp;and&nbsp;natural&nbsp;decoration&nbsp;offer&nbsp;a&nbsp;peaceful&nbsp;Mauritian&nbsp;stay.</span></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p>', 'Anse La Raie', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777704047302-14yo25qauah.jpg', '["Free wifi","Beach towels","Foreign currency exchange","Free mineral sunscreen","Medical care service","Laundry Services","24h reception and security services","parking","Restaurants & Bar","spa","entertainment","Water activities","3 Swimming Pools","land activities","gym"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-02T06:50:23.966+00:00', '2026-05-04T10:06:22.514+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777704220852-u4waxga4en.jpg","services/1777704232046-4vdxo2q4ns2.jpg","services/1777704239855-r36fk8t4u1e.webp","services/1777704252351-ea7mzeqmok5.webp","services/1777704260546-c3rkhg24giw.webp","services/1777704279878-11c2r81ybnyg.jpg","services/1777704299759-rqhmibwmmo.webp","services/1777704312429-6fvkof1w0ow.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>The&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;cancellation&nbsp;policy&nbsp;shall&nbsp;be&nbsp;as&nbsp;follows&nbsp;:</p><p>Canc