('76a822ae-53f8-47dc-9c7c-e1928fac00e6', ' Bali Package (From Backup: sql_2026-05-15)', '<ul><li>4&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;Stay&nbsp;at&nbsp;Grand&nbsp;Mega&nbsp;Resort&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Spa&nbsp;Bali&nbsp;or&nbsp;Similar</li><li>2&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;Stay&nbsp;at&nbsp;Full&nbsp;Moon&nbsp;Villa&nbsp;Ubud&nbsp;or&nbsp;Similar</li><li>Daily&nbsp;Bed&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Breakfast</li><li>Return&nbsp;Airport&nbsp;Transfers</li><li>Water&nbsp;Sports&nbsp;Activities&nbsp;(Banana&nbsp;Boat,&nbsp;Parasailing&nbsp;or&nbsp;Jet&nbsp;Ski)</li><li>Uluwatu&nbsp;Temple&nbsp;Tour</li><li>West&nbsp;Nusa&nbsp;Penida&nbsp;Day&nbsp;Trip&nbsp;(Kelingking&nbsp;Beach,&nbsp;Broken&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Crystal&nbsp;Bay)&nbsp;with&nbsp;Local&nbsp;Lunch</li><li>Ulun&nbsp;Danu&nbsp;Beratan&nbsp;Temple,&nbsp;Handara&nbsp;Gate&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Taman&nbsp;Ayun&nbsp;Temple&nbsp;Tour</li><li>Kintamani&nbsp;(Mount&nbsp;Batur&nbsp;View&nbsp;Point),&nbsp;Coffee&nbsp;Plantation&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Ubud&nbsp;Art&nbsp;Market&nbsp;Visit</li><li>My&nbsp;Swing&nbsp;Experience&nbsp;(Swing&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Bird&nbsp;Nest)</li><li>One&nbsp;Full&nbsp;Day&nbsp;Free&nbsp;for&nbsp;Leisure</li></ul><p></p><p></p><pre data-language="plain">
Experience the magical beauty of Bali with a perfect blend of adventure, culture, and relaxation. From exciting water sports and breathtaking island tours to iconic temples, scenic mountain views, and the charming atmosphere of Ubud, this getaway offers unforgettable moments at every step. Enjoy comfortable stays, daily breakfast, guided excursions, and leisure time while discovering the tropical paradise of Bali.
</pre> (Imported from backup: sql_2026-05-15)', NULL, NULL, 4.5, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T15:00:37.588+00:00', '2026-05-19T15:00:37.588+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, 0, NULL, false, 'Limited Time', true, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('8312e8e2-51ab-4681-bb5d-03a8678ab9d0', 'Friday Attitude (From Backup: sql_2026-05-15)', '<p><span style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;located&nbsp;in&nbsp;eastern&nbsp;Mauritius&nbsp;near&nbsp;Trou&nbsp;d’Eau&nbsp;Douce,&nbsp;a&nbsp;fishing&nbsp;village&nbsp;where&nbsp;colourful&nbsp;boats&nbsp;move&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;tides.&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">In&nbsp;short:&nbsp;peaceful.</strong></p><p><span style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">Just&nbsp;north&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;hotel,&nbsp;Belle&nbsp;Mare&nbsp;stretches&nbsp;out&nbsp;its&nbsp;white-sand&nbsp;carpet,&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;wilder&nbsp;Bras&nbsp;d’Eau&nbsp;forest&nbsp;invites&nbsp;shady&nbsp;walks&nbsp;under&nbsp;filao&nbsp;trees.&nbsp;Right&nbsp;across&nbsp;the&nbsp;lagoon,&nbsp;Île&nbsp;aux&nbsp;Cerfs&nbsp;–&nbsp;reachable&nbsp;by&nbsp;boat&nbsp;–&nbsp;offers&nbsp;golf&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;water&nbsp;and&nbsp;hidden&nbsp;coves.&nbsp;Then&nbsp;there’s&nbsp;Flacq,&nbsp;with&nbsp;its&nbsp;buzzing&nbsp;open-air&nbsp;market,&nbsp;fragrant&nbsp;spices,&nbsp;and&nbsp;colourful&nbsp;fruit&nbsp;stalls.&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">A&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;taste&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius</strong><span style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">.</span></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from backup: sql_2026-05-15)', NULL, NULL, 4.5, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T15:15:13.007+00:00', '2026-05-19T15:15:13.007+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, 0, NULL, false, 'Limited Time', true, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
