('db46bff0-c42f-406a-9ae4-54f455275d60', 'The Curious Corner of Chamarel', '<p>Nestled&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lush&nbsp;highlands&nbsp;of&nbsp;Chamarel,&nbsp;The&nbsp;Curious&nbsp;Corner&nbsp;of&nbsp;Chamarel&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;one-of-a-kind&nbsp;attraction&nbsp;where&nbsp;imagination,&nbsp;illusion,&nbsp;and&nbsp;creativity&nbsp;come&nbsp;together&nbsp;to&nbsp;surprise&nbsp;visitors&nbsp;of&nbsp;all&nbsp;ages.&nbsp;From&nbsp;mind-bending&nbsp;optical&nbsp;illusions&nbsp;and&nbsp;upside-down&nbsp;rooms&nbsp;to&nbsp;interactive&nbsp;exhibits&nbsp;and&nbsp;quirky&nbsp;photo&nbsp;opportunities,&nbsp;every&nbsp;corner&nbsp;invites&nbsp;guests&nbsp;to&nbsp;see&nbsp;the&nbsp;world&nbsp;from&nbsp;a&nbsp;different&nbsp;perspective.&nbsp;Surrounded&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;natural&nbsp;beauty&nbsp;of&nbsp;southwest&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;this&nbsp;playful&nbsp;destination&nbsp;offers&nbsp;a&nbsp;fun&nbsp;and&nbsp;unforgettable&nbsp;experience&nbsp;that&nbsp;blends&nbsp;entertainment,&nbsp;curiosity,&nbsp;and&nbsp;discovery&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;truly&nbsp;unique&nbsp;setting.</p><p></p><p><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(17, 62, 38);">Opening&nbsp;Hours&nbsp;:&nbsp;09:30&nbsp;–&nbsp;17:00&nbsp;daily.</strong></p><p><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(17, 62, 38);">Last&nbsp;Entrance:&nbsp;Typically&nbsp;16:15&nbsp;or&nbsp;16:00.</strong></p><p></p>', 'Chamarel', 'South Coast', 4.5, 'services/1779170106004-pgpreot32s.jpg', '["wifi","Toilet","parking","Gift & puzzle shop","Café / food area","attraction","activities"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T05:55:39.566+00:00', '2026-05-19T06:20:53.163+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1779171096033-5fu9z6s8pg.jpg","services/1779171113337-bsmeddvfd.jpg","services/1779171119820-qt65j1qliee.jpg","services/1779171126558-mjoobn7ts4e.jpg","services/1779171169985-fj4a0a6avr.jpg","services/1779171447182-li45ck25g8.jpg","services/1779