('7cdae51a-8ee8-45c8-9462-a2aba76b7964', 'Tropical Attitude', '<p><span style="color: rgb(16, 76, 82); background-color: rgb(248, 253, 254);">At&nbsp;Tropical&nbsp;Attitude,&nbsp;time&nbsp;becomes&nbsp;wonderfully&nbsp;irrelevant&nbsp;–&nbsp;and&nbsp;that’s&nbsp;exactly&nbsp;its&nbsp;charm.&nbsp;Every&nbsp;room&nbsp;at&nbsp;this&nbsp;intimate&nbsp;boutique&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;opens&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;sea.&nbsp;Your&nbsp;days&nbsp;here&nbsp;follow&nbsp;the&nbsp;tide,&nbsp;the&nbsp;moving&nbsp;shade&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;coconut&nbsp;palms,&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;daily&nbsp;routines&nbsp;of&nbsp;local&nbsp;fishermen.</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color: rgb(16, 76, 82); background-color: rgb(248, 253, 254);">So&nbsp;hit&nbsp;‘pause’.&nbsp;Breathe&nbsp;out.&nbsp;And&nbsp;slip&nbsp;into&nbsp;the&nbsp;laid-back&nbsp;rhythm&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;East&nbsp;Coast.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(16, 76, 82); background-color: rgb(248, 253, 254);">After&nbsp;all,&nbsp;isn’t&nbsp;that&nbsp;what&nbsp;holidays&nbsp;are&nbsp;for?</span></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p>', 'Trou d''eau Douces', 'East Coast', 4.5, 'services/1777707575883-pcbzeqrgch.jpg', '["Free wifi ","laundry services","swimming pool","bar & restaurant","Foreign currency exchange","Lounge","parking","land activities","water activities","Open Air Cinema","Evening Entertainment","spa","outdoor gym"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-02T07:33:34.669+00:00', '2026-05-04T10:07:41.499+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777708193771-w3tl00ew4vs.webp","services/1777708209218-j6rp8imogj.jpg","services/1777708216994-pdoc5q4735q.jpg","services/1777708232868-v4hmky3ywyl.webp","services/1777708252998-n7icstes56b.jpg","services/1777708261262-8bnma56uxqr.jpg","services/1777708292820-0xqperfazoqb.webp","services/1777708307532-a997gv1qk4t.jpg","services/1777708325909-5ldnsmphkpi.webp","services/1777