('f3d590a3-4b16-4fd6-ac1a-13ce11582ea6', 'Mythic Suites & Villas (From JSON Backup: TL_FULL_BACKUP_2026-05-18T08-17-19-209Z.json)', '<p>Nestled&nbsp;in&nbsp;tranquil&nbsp;Grand&nbsp;Gaube,&nbsp;on&nbsp;Mauritius’&nbsp;northern&nbsp;coast,&nbsp;Mythic&nbsp;Suites&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Villas&nbsp;offers&nbsp;an&nbsp;intimate&nbsp;retreat&nbsp;where&nbsp;time&nbsp;stands&nbsp;still.&nbsp;This&nbsp;exclusive&nbsp;estate,&nbsp;officially&nbsp;licensed&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;tourism&nbsp;residence&nbsp;and&nbsp;offering&nbsp;bespoke&nbsp;concierge&nbsp;service,&nbsp;invites&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;unwind,&nbsp;reconnect,&nbsp;and&nbsp;embrace&nbsp;freedom.</p><p>Surrounded&nbsp;by&nbsp;genuine&nbsp;yet&nbsp;discreet&nbsp;attention,&nbsp;each&nbsp;villa&nbsp;for&nbsp;rent&nbsp;on&nbsp;Mauritius&nbsp;and&nbsp;every&nbsp;suite&nbsp;invites&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;experience&nbsp;the&nbsp;island&nbsp;at&nbsp;your&nbsp;own&nbsp;pace&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;serene,&nbsp;sunlit&nbsp;ambiance.</p><p></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;11&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from JSON backup: TL_FULL_BACKUP_2026-05-18T08-17-19-209Z.json)', NULL, NULL, 4.5, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T16:13:30.407+00:00', '2026-05-19T16:13:30.407+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, 0, NULL, false, 'Limited Time', true, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('0f21fcd0-dc44-471d-9247-c36880c12933', 'The Ravenala Attitude', '<p>It’s&nbsp;an&nbsp;exotic&nbsp;journey&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;heart&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius.&nbsp;Nestled&nbsp;between&nbsp;the&nbsp;sea,&nbsp;river,&nbsp;and&nbsp;mountains,&nbsp;The&nbsp;Ravenala&nbsp;Attitude&nbsp;4*&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;true&nbsp;open-air&nbsp;tropical&nbsp;garden.&nbsp;The&nbsp;setting&nbsp;is&nbsp;established&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;atmosphere&nbsp;follows:&nbsp;life&nbsp;flows&nbsp;seamlessly&nbsp;between&nbsp;indoors&nbsp;and&nbsp;outdoors,&nbsp;whether&nbsp;you’re&nbsp;there&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;couple,&nbsp;with&nbsp;family,&nbsp;or&nbsp;with&nbsp;friends—and&nbsp;you&nbsp;simply&nbsp;feel&nbsp;good…&nbsp;naturally.</p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS&nbsp;</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p>', 'Balaclava', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777701345363-ge6iarxcd08.jpg', '["Free wifi","Parking","swimming pool","Currency exchange at the reception","Beach Towel","Restaurant & Bar","kids club","spa","local shop","entertainment","gym","activities"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-02T05:49:41.446+00:00', '2026-05-04T10:01:21.172+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777701394989-71h2lktfx0p.webp","services/1777701417581-vmx64511b4.jpg","services/1777701438570-sii978r8rn.jpg","services/1777701447937-519doxsvxgm.jpg","services/1777701456482-jgc6rnkpqkm.jpg","services/1777701475733-stpekni018.jpg","services/1777701484251-g5d6v1pvuh5.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>Cancellation&nbsp;Policy</p><p>The&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;cancellation&nbsp;policy&nbsp;shall&nbsp;be&nbsp;as&nbsp;follows&nbsp;:</p><p>Cancellation&nbsp;date/period&nbsp;</p><p>Rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Between&nbsp;D-7&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-4:&nbsp;50%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Between&nbsp;D-3&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-1:&nbsp;80%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Peak&nbsp;season&nbsp;between&nbsp;D-30&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-1:&nbsp;100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>No&nbsp;shows:&nbsp;100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Unexpected&nbsp;departure:&nbsp;No&nbsp;refund.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rates&nbsp;are&nbsp;in&nbsp;MUR&nbsp;per&nbsp;room&nbsp;per&nbsp;night&nbsp;on&nbsp;&#39;Half&nbsp;Board&#39;&nbsp;basis&nbsp;[&nbsp;Breakfast&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Dinner&nbsp;].</p><p></p><p>Children&nbsp;who&nbsp;are&nbsp;less&nbsp;than&nbsp;3&nbsp;years&nbsp;old&nbsp;are&nbsp;FOC&nbsp;on&nbsp;parents&nbsp;meal&nbsp;plan&nbsp;booked.</p><p></p><p>Single&nbsp;Parent&nbsp;Policy&nbsp;:&nbsp;1&nbsp;Adult&nbsp;+&nbsp;1&nbsp;Child&nbsp;/&nbsp;Teen&nbsp;=&nbsp;Pays&nbsp;2&nbsp;*&nbsp;1/2&nbsp;Double.</p><p></p><p>A&nbsp;minimum&nbsp;of&nbsp;2&nbsp;children/teens&nbsp;is&nbsp;required&nbsp;per&nbsp;Suite&nbsp;for&nbsp;children/teens&nbsp;in&nbsp;their&nbsp;own&nbsp;Suite.</p><p></p><p>Minimum&nbsp;of&nbsp;2-night&nbsp;stay&nbsp;for&nbsp;All&nbsp;inclusive&nbsp;basis&nbsp;and&nbsp;Half&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Full&nbsp;board&nbsp;basis&nbsp;for&nbsp;1&nbsp;night&nbsp;stay.</p>', NULL, 'services/1777701360093-9rs2tvgzvsn.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1777701373024-xg8njmezay.webp', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'The hotel is located right next to the village of Balaclava and its peaceful beach. The water is clear, the sand is warm, and the atmosphere is serene. Grand Baie is just 15 minutes away for strolling through shops and enjoying the nightlife, while Port Louis is 20 minutes away, known for its vibrant and colorful market.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1777959156787","label":"Half Board"},{"id":"1777959165269","label":"All Inclusive"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('b081c15c-9b79-4bbb-9e7c-debd26ee13ba', 'Malaysia Package ', '<ul><li>6&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;at&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;Royal&nbsp;(or&nbsp;Similar)</li><li>Daily&nbsp;Breakfast&nbsp;Included</li><li>Airport&nbsp;Transfers&nbsp;Included</li><li>Half-Day&nbsp;City&nbsp;Tour&nbsp;</li><li>Half-Day&nbsp;Country&nbsp;Tour&nbsp;to&nbsp;Batu&nbsp;Caves</li><li>Full-Day&nbsp;Genting&nbsp;Highlands&nbsp;Tour&nbsp;(Inclusive&nbsp;of&nbsp;Cable&nbsp;Car&nbsp;Tickets)</li><li>All&nbsp;Tours&nbsp;on&nbsp;Sharing&nbsp;Basis</li></ul><p></p><p>Discover&nbsp;the&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;beauty&nbsp;of&nbsp;Malaysia&nbsp;with&nbsp;an&nbsp;unforgettable&nbsp;journey&nbsp;through&nbsp;modern&nbsp;cities,&nbsp;rich&nbsp;culture,&nbsp;and&nbsp;tropical&nbsp;escapes.&nbsp;Explore&nbsp;the&nbsp;iconic&nbsp;skyline&nbsp;of&nbsp;Kuala&nbsp;Lumpur,&nbsp;experience&nbsp;the&nbsp;heritage&nbsp;charm&nbsp;of&nbsp;George&nbsp;Town,&nbsp;and&nbsp;relax&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;stunning&nbsp;beaches&nbsp;of&nbsp;Langkawi.&nbsp;With&nbsp;comfortable&nbsp;accommodation,&nbsp;daily&nbsp;breakfast,&nbsp;guided&nbsp;tours,&nbsp;and&nbsp;airport&nbsp;transfers&nbsp;included,&nbsp;this&nbsp;package&nbsp;offers&nbsp;the&nbsp;perfect&nbsp;blend&nbsp;of&nbsp;adventure,&nbsp;culture,&nbsp;and&nbsp;relaxation.</p>', NULL, 'MALAYSIA', 4.5, 'services/1778068010670-ar90dlj6nsu.jpg', '[]'::jsonb, 'packages', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-06T11:50:45.188+00:00', '2026-05-08T06:13:01.078+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778068568718-ux7mphiggg.jpg","services/1778068639688-qo7kzbh1lub.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '["Cost of package per person sharing double room"]'::jsonb, '["1. Accommodation (hotels, resorts, or apartments)","2. Airport transfers (in many mid/high-tier packages)","3. Guided tours or sightseeing (depending on the itinerary)","4. Transport between destinations (bus, train, or internal flights)"]'::jsonb, '["1. Exclude Air ticket ","2. Travel insurance 🛡️","3. Visa fees & documentation 🛂","4. Meals & drinks"]'::jsonb, NULL, '<p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(34, 34, 34);">*&nbsp;Conditions&nbsp;apply,&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;availability</span></p>', NULL, 'services/1778068200455-mj3uz1zw09c.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778068084510-st11sn3xaxc.jpeg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Escape to Malaysia — City Vibes, Sky Rides & Iconic Adventures Await', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1778078696416","label":"All inclusive with Drinks"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('9d86212b-1552-41ce-8032-7ee8fd6707fe', 'Ocean''s Creek Beach Hotel', '<p><span style="background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254); color: rgb(103, 105, 118);">Managed&nbsp;by&nbsp;Shanti&nbsp;Hospitality,&nbsp;Ocean&#39;s&nbsp;Creek&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;has&nbsp;nested&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;coastal&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;near&nbsp;Balaclava.&nbsp;With&nbsp;its&nbsp;strategic&nbsp;location,&nbsp;the&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;accessible&nbsp;to&nbsp;every&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;discovering&nbsp;the&nbsp;culture&nbsp;and&nbsp;nature&nbsp;experience&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;island.&nbsp;The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;offers&nbsp;splendid&nbsp;view&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Tombeau&nbsp;River&nbsp;and&nbsp;Le&nbsp;Goulet&nbsp;Beach,&nbsp;offering&nbsp;a&nbsp;warm&nbsp;sunset&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;end&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;day.&nbsp;With&nbsp;365&nbsp;days&nbsp;of&nbsp;versatile&nbsp;fun,&nbsp;Ocean&#39;s&nbsp;Creek&nbsp;ensures&nbsp;a&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;guest&nbsp;experience&nbsp;with&nbsp;its&nbsp;team.</span></p><p></p><p>Check-in&nbsp;at&nbsp;14:00</p><p>Check-out&nbsp;11:00.</p>', 'Balaclava', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777544979317-7689fp46j2w.jpg', '["Wifi ","In-house Cinema"," Laundry service","spa","gym","Up to 50 parking places and coach parking","Water Leisure - Pool & Jacuzzi","Kids Club","Indoor & Outdoor Activities"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30T10:39:15.773+00:00', '2026-04-30T10:41:50.077+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777545040285-k6q0a87zs9c.jpg","services/1777545051493-7kxrofg188e.jpg","services/1777545092213-u7v171yantc.jpg","services/1777545099676-dt17a99janu.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>(No&nbsp;show,&nbsp;shortening&nbsp;of&nbsp;stay,&nbsp;unexpected&nbsp;departure,&nbsp;etc.):</p><p><strong>100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;total&nbsp;booking&nbsp;value/charges</strong>&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;applicable,&nbsp;as&nbsp;from&nbsp;confirmation&nbsp;date.</p>', '<ul><li><ul><li>The&nbsp;above&nbsp;rates&nbsp;are&nbsp;quoted&nbsp;in&nbsp;<strong>MUR</strong>,&nbsp;on&nbsp;<strong>All-Inclusive&nbsp;basis</strong>,&nbsp;and&nbsp;inclusive&nbsp;of&nbsp;all&nbsp;charges.</li><li>Applicable&nbsp;only&nbsp;to&nbsp;<u>new&nbsp;bookings</u>.&nbsp;</li><li>Note&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp;rooms&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;availability&nbsp;upon&nbsp;booking&nbsp;time.</li><li>Check-in&nbsp;at&nbsp;14:00&nbsp;and&nbsp;Check-out&nbsp;11:00.</li><li>Other&nbsp;T&amp;Cs&nbsp;apply.</li></ul></li></ul>', NULL, 'services/1777545007002-cqaqx5iavxl.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1777545016824-dn4hf3bn41.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Managed by Shanti Hospitality, Ocean''s Creek Beach Hotel has nested on the coastal northwest of Mauritius, near Balaclava.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1778141488777","label":"All inclusive"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('59484ee7-c5de-4699-870d-d9e73cb8305c', 'Go Sun Beach Residence', '<p>GoSun&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;Residence&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;beachfront&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;in&nbsp;Flic&nbsp;en&nbsp;Flac,&nbsp;Mauritius.&nbsp;It&nbsp;offers&nbsp;modern&nbsp;rooms,&nbsp;a&nbsp;swimming&nbsp;pool,&nbsp;restaurant,&nbsp;free&nbsp;Wi-Fi,&nbsp;and&nbsp;sea&nbsp;views.&nbsp;The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;close&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;beach,&nbsp;shops,&nbsp;and&nbsp;restaurants,&nbsp;making&nbsp;it&nbsp;good&nbsp;for&nbsp;couples,&nbsp;families,&nbsp;and&nbsp;tourists.</p>', 'Flic en Flac', 'West Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778218865576-kbg412edvr.jpg', '[]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-08T05:45:45.334+00:00', '2026-05-08T05:45:45.333+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778218920594-pcphblqfb1.jpg","services/1778218932354-t5r9wo4pyt.webp","services/1778218945623-h1mhvnzuwyc.jpg","services/1778218960489-yfkw2ydi3f.jpg","services/1778218969646-nrdq483qgbp.jpg","services/1778218982065-vbp2jbud1j.webp","services/1778219116297-k8zth0fpaq.jpg","services/1778219134316-wjobi563fw.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1778218893262-etz5qwi7jwj.webp', false, 0, 'services/1778218904356-3hct6plgs22.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'GoSun Beach Residence is a beachfront hotel in Mauritius with sea-view rooms, pool, Wi-Fi, and easy beach access.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1778220153551","label":"Bed & Breakfast"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('baebb519-5619-49f2-80e6-02ad2aff431f', 'Istanbul  Package (From Backup: sql_2026-05-16)', '<ul><li>5&nbsp;Nights’&nbsp;Stay&nbsp;at&nbsp;Four&nbsp;Lions&nbsp;Taksim&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;(or&nbsp;Similar)</li><li>Bed&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Breakfast</li><li>Airport&nbsp;Transfers</li><li>Full-Day&nbsp;Bosphorus&nbsp;Tour</li><li>Full-Day&nbsp;Bursa&nbsp;Tour</li><li>Old&nbsp;City&nbsp;Tour</li></ul><p></p><p>Experience&nbsp;the&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;charm&nbsp;of&nbsp;Istanbul&nbsp;with&nbsp;its&nbsp;rich&nbsp;history,&nbsp;stunning&nbsp;architecture,&nbsp;scenic&nbsp;Bosphorus&nbsp;views,&nbsp;and&nbsp;unforgettable&nbsp;cultural&nbsp;attractions.</p> (Imported from backup: sql_2026-05-16)', NULL, NULL, 4.5, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T15:02:03.892+00:00', '2026-05-19T15:02:03.892+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, 0, NULL, false, 'Limited Time', true, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('30b10301-14fb-4638-add4-ec6712177418', 'Casela Nature Parks', '<p>Casela&nbsp;Nature&nbsp;Parks&nbsp;is&nbsp;one&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;popular&nbsp;outdoor&nbsp;attractions&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;located&nbsp;near&nbsp;the&nbsp;west&nbsp;coast&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;region&nbsp;of&nbsp;Flic&nbsp;en&nbsp;Flac.&nbsp;It&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;large&nbsp;adventure&nbsp;and&nbsp;wildlife&nbsp;park&nbsp;known&nbsp;for&nbsp;its&nbsp;mix&nbsp;of&nbsp;safari&nbsp;experiences,&nbsp;animal&nbsp;encounters,&nbsp;and&nbsp;adrenaline&nbsp;activities.&nbsp;Visitors&nbsp;can&nbsp;see&nbsp;animals&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;lions,&nbsp;zebras,&nbsp;giraffes,&nbsp;and&nbsp;various&nbsp;bird&nbsp;species,&nbsp;either&nbsp;on&nbsp;guided&nbsp;safari&nbsp;tours&nbsp;or&nbsp;in&nbsp;more&nbsp;interactive&nbsp;experiences&nbsp;like&nbsp;feeding&nbsp;sessions.&nbsp;Beyond&nbsp;wildlife,&nbsp;Casela&nbsp;also&nbsp;offers&nbsp;activities&nbsp;like&nbsp;zip-lining,&nbsp;quad&nbsp;biking,&nbsp;canyoning,&nbsp;and&nbsp;walking&nbsp;with&nbsp;lions,&nbsp;making&nbsp;it&nbsp;a&nbsp;destination&nbsp;that&nbsp;blends&nbsp;nature,&nbsp;adventure,&nbsp;and&nbsp;family-friendly&nbsp;entertainment&nbsp;in&nbsp;one&nbsp;place.&nbsp;Its&nbsp;scenic&nbsp;views&nbsp;of&nbsp;mountains&nbsp;and&nbsp;coastline&nbsp;add&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;overall&nbsp;experience,&nbsp;making&nbsp;it&nbsp;a&nbsp;must-visit&nbsp;spot&nbsp;for&nbsp;tourists&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mauritius.</p>', 'Cascavelle', 'West Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778919821391-lwao438bb3.jpg', '["Wifi","toilet","attraction","activities","4D Cinema","Kids’ playground areas","Souvenir shops","Shuttle transport inside the park","Restaurants & cafés"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-16T08:44:21.596+00:00', '2026-05-16T08:44:21.596+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778920226236-hh08rkpaob.png","services/1778920232339-pq0rebdhsi.jpg","services/1778920243585-vvzb2vk95oh.png","services/1778920259566-79ewwyqm4jc.png","services/1778920265348-lphodetjcfd.jpg","services/1778920274622-g7hsbpjhrv.png","services/1778920307097-b0ppg37dffu.jpg","services/1778920322187-4sg0gmb4cvk.jpg","services/1778920336349-kgcfou73rao.png","services/1778920478227-nia5sh9yyk.png"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1778919828977-1vxg30uten2.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778919843746-svapra6ttmh.png', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Open since 1979, Casela Nature Parks offers visitors 5 distinct areas to discover, marvel, and connect with nature and wildlife. The park is one of the favourite attractions for Mauritian families, couples, children, seniors, and tourists!', NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, 'Land', 0, NULL),
('876b3848-829c-4bbe-8b8d-2f89158d2fee', ' Bali Package', '<ul><li>4&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;Stay&nbsp;at&nbsp;Grand&nbsp;Mega&nbsp;Resort&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Spa&nbsp;Bali&nbsp;or&nbsp;Similar</li><li>2&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;Stay&nbsp;at&nbsp;Full&nbsp;Moon&nbsp;Villa&nbsp;Ubud&nbsp;or&nbsp;Similar</li><li>Daily&nbsp;Bed&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Breakfast</li><li>Return&nbsp;Airport&nbsp;Transfers</li><li>Water&nbsp;Sports&nbsp;Activities&nbsp;(Banana&nbsp;Boat,&nbsp;Parasailing&nbsp;or&nbsp;Jet&nbsp;Ski)</li><li>Uluwatu&nbsp;Temple&nbsp;Tour</li><li>West&nbsp;Nusa&nbsp;Penida&nbsp;Day&nbsp;Trip&nbsp;(Kelingking&nbsp;Beach,&nbsp;Broken&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Crystal&nbsp;Bay)&nbsp;with&nbsp;Local&nbsp;Lunch</li><li>Ulun&nbsp;Danu&nbsp;Beratan&nbsp;Temple,&nbsp;Handara&nbsp;Gate&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Taman&nbsp;Ayun&nbsp;Temple&nbsp;Tour</li><li>Kintamani&nbsp;(Mount&nbsp;Batur&nbsp;View&nbsp;Point),&nbsp;Coffee&nbsp;Plantation&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Ubud&nbsp;Art&nbsp;Market&nbsp;Visit</li><li>My&nbsp;Swing&nbsp;Experience&nbsp;(Swing&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Bird&nbsp;Nest)</li><li>One&nbsp;Full&nbsp;Day&nbsp;Free&nbsp;for&nbsp;Leisure</li></ul><p></p><p></p><pre data-language="plain">
