('6043c9ce-afa7-4fb1-a27e-4aaafca39785', 'Friday Attitude', '<p><span style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;located&nbsp;in&nbsp;eastern&nbsp;Mauritius&nbsp;near&nbsp;Trou&nbsp;d’Eau&nbsp;Douce,&nbsp;a&nbsp;fishing&nbsp;village&nbsp;where&nbsp;colourful&nbsp;boats&nbsp;move&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;tides.&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">In&nbsp;short:&nbsp;peaceful.</strong></p><p><span style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">Just&nbsp;north&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;hotel,&nbsp;Belle&nbsp;Mare&nbsp;stretches&nbsp;out&nbsp;its&nbsp;white-sand&nbsp;carpet,&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;wilder&nbsp;Bras&nbsp;d’Eau&nbsp;forest&nbsp;invites&nbsp;shady&nbsp;walks&nbsp;under&nbsp;filao&nbsp;trees.&nbsp;Right&nbsp;across&nbsp;the&nbsp;lagoon,&nbsp;Île&nbsp;aux&nbsp;Cerfs&nbsp;–&nbsp;reachable&nbsp;by&nbsp;boat&nbsp;–&nbsp;offers&nbsp;golf&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;water&nbsp;and&nbsp;hidden&nbsp;coves.&nbsp;Then&nbsp;there’s&nbsp;Flacq,&nbsp;with&nbsp;its&nbsp;buzzing&nbsp;open-air&nbsp;market,&nbsp;fragrant&nbsp;spices,&nbsp;and&nbsp;colourful&nbsp;fruit&nbsp;stalls.&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">A&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;taste&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius</strong><span style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">.</span></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p>', 'Trou d''eau Douces', 'East Coast', 4.5, 'services/1777875347127-imon16godop.jpg', '["Free wifi","swimming pool","Restaurant & bar","kids club","spa","Land activities","evening entertainment","yoga and meditation","water activities","fREE Beach towels & mineral sunscreen","Baby-sitting service","LAUNDRY SERVICES","Foreign currency exchange","PARKING","Shower and luggage rooms"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-04T06:16:38.31+00:00', '2