('75c95246-d1b0-4a1a-aa06-279fb9dc09e3', 'Full-Day Catamaran Trip to Gabriel Island', '<p>Île&nbsp;aux&nbsp;Gabriel&nbsp;catamaran&nbsp;trips&nbsp;are&nbsp;among&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;scenic&nbsp;experiences&nbsp;in&nbsp;northern&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;combining&nbsp;island&nbsp;hopping,&nbsp;snorkeling,&nbsp;and&nbsp;relaxing&nbsp;sailing&nbsp;across&nbsp;clear&nbsp;lagoon&nbsp;waters.</p><p>The&nbsp;route&nbsp;often&nbsp;includes&nbsp;stops&nbsp;at&nbsp;Île&nbsp;Plate,&nbsp;known&nbsp;for&nbsp;its&nbsp;long&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;beaches&nbsp;and&nbsp;shallow&nbsp;turquoise&nbsp;waters&nbsp;ideal&nbsp;for&nbsp;swimming.&nbsp;Boats&nbsp;also&nbsp;pass&nbsp;near&nbsp;Coin&nbsp;de&nbsp;Mire,&nbsp;a&nbsp;dramatic&nbsp;rocky&nbsp;islet&nbsp;popular&nbsp;for&nbsp;birdlife&nbsp;and&nbsp;photography.</p><p>Onboard,&nbsp;visitors&nbsp;typically&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;barbecue&nbsp;lunches,&nbsp;music,&nbsp;and&nbsp;sunbathing&nbsp;on&nbsp;deck&nbsp;while&nbsp;cruising&nbsp;between&nbsp;islands.&nbsp;The&nbsp;calm&nbsp;northern&nbsp;sea&nbsp;conditions&nbsp;make&nbsp;it&nbsp;suitable&nbsp;for&nbsp;families,&nbsp;while&nbsp;the&nbsp;coral&nbsp;reefs&nbsp;offer&nbsp;frequent&nbsp;sightings&nbsp;of&nbsp;colorful&nbsp;fish&nbsp;and&nbsp;marine&nbsp;biodiversity&nbsp;during&nbsp;snorkeling&nbsp;stops.</p>', 'Balaclava', 'North Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778911832092-jtute24pzyi.jpg', '["BBQ LUNCH","SOFT DRINKS & ALCOHOL","MUSIC & ENTERTAINMENT","SNORKELING"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-16T06:17:26.268+00:00', '2026-05-16T06:25:35.832+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778911952045-9883kjpvx1.jpg","services/1778911967429-o3f9sl0zhog.jpg","services/1778911974189-p6mhb1ujszh.webp","services/1778911989555-a890j6kx1wt.jpg","services/1778912015282-spqhs21awz.jpg","services/1778912040356-fez491ihew.jpg","services/1778912095929-4cgf0nvhzku.jpg","services/1778912406790-6gozqx5n3dr.jpg","services/1778912730015-4ha4f2ntqlq.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', N