('66dd0494-622f-4390-9a0c-378728046008', 'Water Activities at Belle Mare Beach', '<p>At&nbsp;Belle&nbsp;Mare&nbsp;Beach,&nbsp;water&nbsp;activities&nbsp;like&nbsp;tube&nbsp;rides,&nbsp;parasailing,&nbsp;and&nbsp;undersea&nbsp;walking&nbsp;offer&nbsp;a&nbsp;mix&nbsp;of&nbsp;excitement&nbsp;and&nbsp;discovery,&nbsp;where&nbsp;tube&nbsp;rides&nbsp;bring&nbsp;fast,&nbsp;splashy&nbsp;thrills&nbsp;across&nbsp;the&nbsp;lagoon,&nbsp;parasailing&nbsp;provides&nbsp;stunning&nbsp;aerial&nbsp;views&nbsp;over&nbsp;the&nbsp;turquoise&nbsp;ocean,&nbsp;and&nbsp;undersea&nbsp;walks&nbsp;allow&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;explore&nbsp;coral&nbsp;reefs&nbsp;and&nbsp;marine&nbsp;life&nbsp;up&nbsp;close&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;safe,&nbsp;guided&nbsp;experience.</p>', 'Belle Mare', 'East Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778919053527-qy6spely1e.jpg', '["Parasailing","Tube Rides","Undersea walk"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-16T08:11:02.742+00:00', '2026-05-16T08:11:02.742+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778918789481-bno1tffrfs4.jpg","services/1778918802177-a1je8qzxt5.jpg","services/1778918819614-3yo6rye2i8w.jpg","services/1778918829536-m7qprkca6x.jpg","services/1778918857610-pe6vb4jw3gg.jpg","services/1778919022546-c628s0gidd.jpg","services/1778919033100-coso3t2mp3l.webp"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1778918771715-nkknqlejpc.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778918762996-6lx23b8pd8t.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'At Belle Mare Beach, tube rides, parasailing, and undersea walks offer thrilling marine adventures.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, 'Sea', 0, NULL),
('6e55f700-0585-4c44-b28a-870a6be06bbf', 'Chalets Chamarel', '<p>Chalets&nbsp;Chamarel&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;unique&nbsp;property&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;island.&nbsp;The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;offers&nbsp;9&nbsp;Double&nbsp;deluxe&nbsp;chalets&nbsp;and&nbsp;2&nbsp;spacious&nbsp;suites&nbsp;perched&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;ridges&nbsp;of&nbsp;Chamarel&nbsp;mountain&nbsp;‘Piton&nbsp;La&nbsp;Porte’&nbsp;with&nbsp;exceptional&nbsp;panoramic&nbsp;views&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;west&nbsp;coast&nbsp;on&nbsp;one&nbsp;side&nbsp;and&nbsp;breathtaking&nbsp;views&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;forests&nbsp;of&nbsp;Chamarel&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;other.</p><p>On&nbsp;the&nbsp;west&nbsp;coast&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;43&nbsp;km&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;airport.&nbsp;It’s&nbsp;located&nbsp;just&nbsp;after&nbsp;the&nbsp;Seven&nbsp;Coloured&nbsp;Earths&nbsp;Chamarel&nbsp;and&nbsp;share&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;entrance.&nbsp;The&nbsp;closest&nbsp;beach&nbsp;is&nbsp;15km&nbsp;away,&nbsp;50&nbsp;km&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;capital&nbsp;city&nbsp;of&nbsp;Port-Louis&nbsp;as&nbsp;well&nbsp;as&nbsp;being&nbsp;15km&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;closest&nbsp;shopping&nbsp;center.</p><p>Adults-only&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;(as&nbsp;from&nbsp;15&nbsp;years)</p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;11&nbsp;HRS</p>', 'Chamarel', 'South Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778226060777-dcq6ktjn3pd.jpg', '["Free Wifi","Swimming Pool","scenic viewpoints","Restaurant & Bar","Air conditioning in rooms","sea view","Free parking"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-08T07:50:59.854+00:00', '2026-05-11T12:36:09.565+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778226559681-xc6jt3odpq.webp","services/1778226568920-536rdg34tsn.webp","services/1778226576507-vd53gte8g3b.webp","services/1778226588769-m14mifk52m8.webp","services/1778226596488-kirpmdqf3w8.jpg","services/1778226616673-obfvwwfscra.webp","services/1778226630976-p3g4iivi1b.jpg","services/1778226647599-lgoid4240cn.jpg"]