('6faa2def-754f-4b0d-aaaf-f909cef77a05', 'Zilwa Attitude', '<p>Need&nbsp;to&nbsp;let&nbsp;off&nbsp;steam&nbsp;or&nbsp;recharge&nbsp;your&nbsp;batteries?&nbsp;Want&nbsp;to&nbsp;practice&nbsp;an&nbsp;activity&nbsp;on&nbsp;dry&nbsp;land&nbsp;or&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;water?&nbsp;At&nbsp;4*&nbsp;Zilwa&nbsp;Attitude&nbsp;hotel,&nbsp;give&nbsp;free&nbsp;rein&nbsp;to&nbsp;your&nbsp;desires&nbsp;and&nbsp;your&nbsp;curiosity.&nbsp;You&nbsp;can&nbsp;try&nbsp;stand-up&nbsp;paddleboarding,&nbsp;water&nbsp;aerobics,&nbsp;tennis&nbsp;or&nbsp;even&nbsp;tai&nbsp;chi.&nbsp;There&nbsp;are&nbsp;a&nbsp;wide&nbsp;range&nbsp;of&nbsp;activities&nbsp;available&nbsp;for&nbsp;your&nbsp;relaxation&nbsp;and&nbsp;pleasure,&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;added&nbsp;bonus&nbsp;of&nbsp;exploring&nbsp;the&nbsp;superb&nbsp;lagoon!</p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p>', 'Calodyne', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777702743614-letpgw4nwu.jpg', '["Free wifi","laundry services","Beach towels","Baby changing room","Foreign currency exchange service","Local shop","Computer with Internet access","spa","restaurant","swimming pool","Water activities","gym","entertainment","board games","Land Activities","kids activities"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-02T06:27:18.872+00:00', '2026-05-09T07:19:46.089+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777702779794-cfesxst5v6.jpg","services/1777702786264-pc3guj0r3i.jpg","services/1777702889430-rj8h6ot5tak.jpg","services/1777702896481-ybhj69oefv.jpg","services/1777702904290-px0cix31gj.jpg","services/1777703046311-66e1pdt4508.jpg","services/1777703149335-bpr39onsts.jpg","services/1777703158030-0wv9ywkaxk1a.jpg","services/1777703174337-8w1e3er2wbl.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>Cancellation&nbsp;Policy</p><p>The&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;cancellation&nbsp;policy&nbsp;shall&nbsp;be&nbsp;as&nbsp;follows&nbsp;:</p><p>Cancellation&nbsp;date/period&nbsp;</p><p>Rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Between&nbsp;D-7&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-4:&nbsp;50%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Between&nbsp;D-3&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-1:&nbsp;80%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Peak&nbsp;season&nbsp;between&nbsp;D-30&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-1:&nbsp;100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>No&nbsp;shows:&nbsp;100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Unexpected&nbsp;departure:&nbsp;No&nbsp;refund.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rates&nbsp;are&nbsp;in&nbsp;MUR&nbsp;per&nbsp;room&nbsp;per&nbsp;night&nbsp;on&nbsp;&#39;Half&nbsp;Board&#39;&nbsp;basis&nbsp;[&nbsp;Breakfast&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Dinner&nbsp;].</p><p></p><p>Children&nbsp;who&nbsp;are&nbsp;less&nbsp;than&nbsp;3&nbsp;years&nbsp;old&nbsp;are&nbsp;FOC&nbsp;on&nbsp;parents&nbsp;meal&nbsp;plan&nbsp;booked.</p><p></p><p>A&nbsp;minimum&nbsp;of&nbsp;2&nbsp;children/teens&nbsp;is&nbsp;required&nbsp;per&nbsp;room&nbsp;for&nbsp;children/teens&nbsp;in&nbsp;their&nbsp;own&nbsp;room.</p><p></p><p>Single&nbsp;Parent&nbsp;Policy&nbsp;:&nbsp;1&nbsp;Adult&nbsp;+&nbsp;1&nbsp;Child&nbsp;/&nbsp;Teen&nbsp;=&nbsp;Pays&nbsp;2&nbsp;*&nbsp;1/2&nbsp;Double.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Minimum&nbsp;of&nbsp;2-night&nbsp;stay&nbsp;for&nbsp;All&nbsp;inclusive&nbsp;basis&nbsp;and&nbsp;Half&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Full&nbsp;board&nbsp;basis&nbsp;for&nbsp;1&nbsp;night&nbsp;stay</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 'services/1777702732354-ku5rihge00i.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1777702763969-pt1h3a3ybot.webp', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Zilwa Attitude is a relaxed beachfront hotel in Mauritius with a local island vibe, offering simple comfort, good food, and beautiful lagoon views.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1777895854877","label":"Half Board"},{"id":"1777895866328","label":"All Inclusive"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('655f690f-2cd9-40db-9b8f-73fd28363fb2', 'Orchid Villas by Sea Resorts Hotels', '<p>Orchid&nbsp;Villas,&nbsp;located&nbsp;along&nbsp;the&nbsp;Coastal&nbsp;Road&nbsp;of&nbsp;Belle&nbsp;Mare,&nbsp;is&nbsp;an&nbsp;exclusive&nbsp;collection&nbsp;of&nbsp;six&nbsp;private&nbsp;pool&nbsp;villas,&nbsp;each&nbsp;featuring&nbsp;three&nbsp;bedrooms,&nbsp;designed&nbsp;to&nbsp;offer&nbsp;privacy,&nbsp;comfort,&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;refined&nbsp;island&nbsp;living&nbsp;experience.&nbsp;Ideal&nbsp;for&nbsp;families,&nbsp;the&nbsp;villas&nbsp;combine&nbsp;contemporary&nbsp;amenities&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;relaxed,&nbsp;upscale&nbsp;atmosphere,&nbsp;in&nbsp;line&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;boutique&nbsp;standards&nbsp;of&nbsp;Sea&nbsp;Resorts.</p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;TIME&nbsp;:&nbsp;15.00</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;TIME&nbsp;:&nbsp;10.00</p>', 'Belle Mare', 'East Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778832765520-3bjkfjohlto.jpg', '["fREE WIFI","Private outdoor swimming pool","Restaurant & bar","free parking"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-15T08:19:08.218+00:00', '2026-05-15T08:19:08.218+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778832886446-fai42k5dhm9.jpg","services/1778832930592-x4mi8a00fmp.jpg","services/1778832945071-rxl9o15212.jpg","services/1778832959932-xox6c9779b.jpg","services/1778832976318-cb9t5pi9gyo.jpg","services/1778833012442-rh2kyzf55bj.jpg","services/1778833025658-n18xob4o54n.jpg","services/1778833113274-vtwkltnnczk.jpg","services/1778833127350-io6rwt8g38h.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>Cancellations&nbsp;of&nbsp;14&nbsp;days&nbsp;or&nbsp;less&nbsp;prior&nbsp;to&nbsp;arrival&nbsp;or&nbsp;No&nbsp;shows&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;charged&nbsp;50%&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;total&nbsp;reservation&nbsp;amount&nbsp;Cancellations&nbsp;of&nbsp;07&nbsp;days&nbsp;or&nbsp;less&nbsp;prior&nbsp;to&nbsp;arrival&nbsp;or&nbsp;No&nbsp;shows&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;charged&nbsp;100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;t