('1702896b-11a0-4767-bc33-25ca699a2972', 'Anelia Resort & Spa', '<h4 class="ql-align-center"><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">With&nbsp;a&nbsp;room&nbsp;capacity&nbsp;of&nbsp;141,&nbsp;Anelia&nbsp;Resort&nbsp;offers&nbsp;a&nbsp;panoply&nbsp;of&nbsp;accommodation&nbsp;ranging&nbsp;from&nbsp;individual&nbsp;villas&nbsp;set&nbsp;in&nbsp;an&nbsp;authentic&nbsp;“village&nbsp;creole”,&nbsp;guest&nbsp;rooms&nbsp;in&nbsp;typical&nbsp;Mauritian&nbsp;architecture&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;new&nbsp;superior&nbsp;rooms&nbsp;designed&nbsp;in&nbsp;modern&nbsp;and&nbsp;contemporary&nbsp;style.&nbsp;Come&nbsp;and&nbsp;make&nbsp;at&nbsp;Anelia,&nbsp;a&nbsp;catching&nbsp;discovery&nbsp;where&nbsp;old&nbsp;blends&nbsp;with&nbsp;new&nbsp;and&nbsp;experience&nbsp;the&nbsp;evolutionary&nbsp;development&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritian&nbsp;living&nbsp;over&nbsp;the&nbsp;past&nbsp;century.</strong></h4><p class="ql-align-center"></p><p class="ql-align-center">Check&nbsp;in&nbsp;time:&nbsp;14hr00</p><p class="ql-align-center">Check&nbsp;out&nbsp;time:&nbsp;11hr00.</p> (Imported from JSON backup)', NULL, NULL, 4.5, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T15:27:20.882+00:00', '2026-05-19T15:27:20.882+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, 0, NULL, false, 'Limited Time', true, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('8227101e-49ac-4a41-9ac0-d4a94bc7bf6d', 'Coral Azur Beach Resort (From Backup: May 18)', '<p><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">At&nbsp;Coral&nbsp;Azur&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;Resort,&nbsp;we&nbsp;take&nbsp;your&nbsp;holidays&nbsp;seriously!&nbsp;For&nbsp;the&nbsp;last&nbsp;thirty&nbsp;years,&nbsp;our&nbsp;ethos&nbsp;is&nbsp;to&nbsp;make&nbsp;every&nbsp;holiday&nbsp;one&nbsp;to&nbsp;remember&nbsp;with&nbsp;our&nbsp;caring&nbsp;and&nbsp;personalized&nbsp;service,&nbsp;delivered&nbsp;by&nbsp;a&nbsp;team&nbsp;of&nbsp;passionate&nbsp;team&nbsp;members.&nbsp;Authentic&nbsp;warmth&nbsp;and&nbsp;generosity,&nbsp;this&nbsp;is&nbsp;what&nbsp;drives&nbsp;each&nbsp;member&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;each&nbsp;day!&nbsp;While&nbsp;complying&nbsp;to&nbsp;high-quality&nbsp;hospitality&nbsp;standards,&nbsp;they&nbsp;are&nbsp;on&nbsp;a&nbsp;mission:&nbsp;meet&nbsp;all&nbsp;your&nbsp;needs&nbsp;while&nbsp;making&nbsp;sure&nbsp;you&nbsp;experience&nbsp;the&nbsp;local&nbsp;Art&nbsp;of&nbsp;living!</span></p> (Imported from backup variant: Git Branch: backup/2026-05-18_1854 (SQL))', 'Mont Choisy', 'North Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778142053864-dmz0aso11r.jpg', '["Free Wifi","spa","land and water activities","kids club","Bar and Restaurant","Entertainment"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T19:52:57.274821+00:00', '2026-05-19T19:52:57.274821+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778142391661-kzd3vfbwi0q.webp","services/1778142402034-sboptk11pjh.jpg","services/1778142423685-a1jyazc2v9f.webp","services/1778142439699-7tocqwz81ks.jpg","services/1778142449010-705ytzwqus.jpg","services/1778142461837-ou0v6phmdqn.webp","services/1778503508026-6xljn96v32j.webp"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1778503465663-yrawwh7cu9k.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778142025807-vrwjihzuz5.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Coral Azur Beach Res