('a4ccdedd-1bc6-469e-a420-e8be382e3f18', 'Coin de Mire Attitude Hotel (From Backup: May 18)', '<p>Situated&nbsp;on&nbsp;Mauritius’s&nbsp;northern&nbsp;tip,&nbsp;the&nbsp;3*+&nbsp;Coin&nbsp;de&nbsp;Mire&nbsp;Attitude&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;enjoys&nbsp;an&nbsp;exceptional&nbsp;position&nbsp;between&nbsp;Grand&nbsp;Baie,&nbsp;an&nbsp;unmissable&nbsp;and&nbsp;lively&nbsp;resort&nbsp;town,&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;picturesque,&nbsp;fishing&nbsp;village&nbsp;of&nbsp;Cap&nbsp;Malheureux.</p><p>Looking&nbsp;straight&nbsp;out&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;island’s&nbsp;surrounding&nbsp;lagoon,&nbsp;Coin&nbsp;de&nbsp;Mire&nbsp;Attitude&nbsp;sits&nbsp;opposite&nbsp;the&nbsp;entrance&nbsp;to&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;Bain&nbsp;Boeuf&nbsp;beach.&nbsp;This&nbsp;peaceful&nbsp;cove&nbsp;offers&nbsp;splendid&nbsp;seas&nbsp;views&nbsp;over&nbsp;colourful&nbsp;fishing&nbsp;boats&nbsp;and&nbsp;turquoise&nbsp;waters&nbsp;towards&nbsp;the&nbsp;iconic&nbsp;coral&nbsp;island&nbsp;of&nbsp;Coin&nbsp;de&nbsp;Mire&nbsp;(or&nbsp;Gunner’s&nbsp;Quoin).</p><p class="ql-align-center"></p><p class="ql-align-center">Check-in&nbsp;time:&nbsp;14:00</p><p class="ql-align-center">Check-&nbsp;out&nbsp;time:&nbsp;12:00</p> (Imported from backup variant: Git Branch: backup/2026-05-18_1854 (SQL))', 'Cap Malheureux', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777710848372-glrvltmgks.jpg', '["Free Wi-Fi","Laundry (at extra cost)","Free parking","Beach towels and mineral sunscreen available for free","AC in room","Mobile device charging corner available at reception"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T20:18:49.30156+00:00', '2026-05-19T20:18:49.30156+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778137603818-9yquhz2foua.jpg","services/1778137613023-nmz0dtkrh3.jpg","services/1778137619463-e2r2xjyziec.jpg","services/1778137637780-c4bmlxec7ja.jpg","services/1778137649193-m93jezlgmh9.webp","services/1778137662243-h0nddziz69m.webp","services/1778137680612-fz94k2gtpcp.webp"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL