('adbb5ebe-11ae-40f9-a9ce-ab6aff41ed34', 'Chalets Chamarel (From Backup: May 18)', '<p>Chalets&nbsp;Chamarel&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;unique&nbsp;property&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;island.&nbsp;The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;offers&nbsp;9&nbsp;Double&nbsp;deluxe&nbsp;chalets&nbsp;and&nbsp;2&nbsp;spacious&nbsp;suites&nbsp;perched&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;ridges&nbsp;of&nbsp;Chamarel&nbsp;mountain&nbsp;‘Piton&nbsp;La&nbsp;Porte’&nbsp;with&nbsp;exceptional&nbsp;panoramic&nbsp;views&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;west&nbsp;coast&nbsp;on&nbsp;one&nbsp;side&nbsp;and&nbsp;breathtaking&nbsp;views&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;forests&nbsp;of&nbsp;Chamarel&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;other.</p><p>On&nbsp;the&nbsp;west&nbsp;coast&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;43&nbsp;km&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;airport.&nbsp;It’s&nbsp;located&nbsp;just&nbsp;after&nbsp;the&nbsp;Seven&nbsp;Coloured&nbsp;Earths&nbsp;Chamarel&nbsp;and&nbsp;share&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;entrance.&nbsp;The&nbsp;closest&nbsp;beach&nbsp;is&nbsp;15km&nbsp;away,&nbsp;50&nbsp;km&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;capital&nbsp;city&nbsp;of&nbsp;Port-Louis&nbsp;as&nbsp;well&nbsp;as&nbsp;being&nbsp;15km&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;closest&nbsp;shopping&nbsp;center.</p><p>Adults-only&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;(as&nbsp;from&nbsp;15&nbsp;years)</p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;11&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from backup variant: Git Branch: backup/2026-05-18_1854 (SQL))', 'Chamarel', 'South Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778226060777-dcq6ktjn3pd.jpg', '["Free Wifi","Swimming Pool","scenic viewpoints","Restaurant & Bar","Air conditioning in rooms","sea view","Free parking"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T20:19:22.752604+00:00', '2026-05-19T20:19:22.752604+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778226559681-xc6jt3odpq.webp","services/1778226568920-536rdg34tsn.webp","services/1778226576507-vd53gte8g3b.webp","services/1778226588769-m14mifk52m8.webp","services/1778226596488-kirpmdqf3w8.jpg","services/1778226616673-obfvwwfscra.webp","services/1778226630976-p3g4iivi1b.jpg","services/1778226647599-lgoid4240cn.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1778502961019-ksyt7lgen8.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778226095587-slnrhs4z5r.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Chalet Chamarel is an adults-only eco-retreat in Mauritius offering hillside chalets with panoramic ocean, forest, and mountain views.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1778226734417","label":"Half Board"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL);

